          "description": "When fighting inside its lair, the dragon can invoke ambient magic on initiative count 20 (losing initiative ties) to take one of the following lair actions:\n• Freezing fog fills a 20-foot-radius sphere centered on a point within 120 feet. Each creature in the fog must make a DC 10 Constitution saving throw, taking 10 (3d6) cold damage on a failed save, or half on a success.\n• Jagged ice shards fall from the ceiling, striking up to three creatures underneath within 120 feet (+7 to hit, 10 [3d6] piercing damage).\n• The dragon creates an opaque wall of ice on a solid surface within 120 feet (up to 30 ft. long, 30 ft. high, 1 ft. thick)."
        },
