          "description": "The dragon exhales shadowy acid in a 15-foot line that is 5 feet wide. Each creature in that area must make a DC 11 Dexterity saving throw, taking 22 (5d8) necrotic damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. A humanoid reduced to 0 hit points by this damage dies, and an undead shadow rises from its corpse and acts immediately after the dragon in the initiative count under the dragon's control.",
