          "name": "Bite",
          "description": "Melee Weapon Attack: +7 to hit, reach 10 ft., one target. Hit: 13 (3d6 + 3) piercing damage plus 17 (5d6) necrotic damage, reducing the target's hit point maximum by the necrotic damage taken."
        },
        {
          "category": "Action",
          "name": "Shadow Web",
          "description": "Ranged Weapon Attack: +7 to hit, reach 120 ft., one creature. Hit: 16 (3d10) necrotic damage, and the target has the grappled condition (escape DC 15)."
        },
        {
          "category": "Action",
          "name": "Reel",
          "description": "The darkweaver pulls each creature it has grappled up to 60 feet toward itself."
        },
        {
          "category": "Lair Action",
          "name": "Lair Actions",
          "description": "On initiative count 20 (losing initiative ties), a darkweaver can take one of the following lair actions:\n• Extinguish: Nonmagical flames within 30 feet are extinguished and light spells of 2nd level or lower are dispelled.\n• Shadow Fears: Each creature grappled by Shadow Web must make a DC 15 Wisdom save or be frightened until the end of its next turn.\n• Shadow Step: Teleports up to 60 feet in dim light or darkness."
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "Aberration"
      ]
    },
