          "category": "Action",
          "name": "Multiattack",
          "description": "The eater of knowledge makes two Slam attacks. If both attacks hit the same Large or smaller creature, it has the grappled condition (escape DC 14) and must succeed on a DC 15 Intelligence saving throw or have the stunned condition until the grapple ends."
        },
        {
          "category": "Action",
          "name": "Slam",
          "description": "Melee Weapon Attack: +7 to hit, reach 5 ft., one target. Hit: 11 (2d6 + 4) bludgeoning damage."
        },
        {
          "category": "Action",
          "name": "Extract Brain",
          "description": "Melee Weapon Attack: +7 to hit, reach 5 ft., one Humanoid with the incapacitated condition. Hit: 45 (10d8) piercing damage. If this damage reduces the target to 0 hit points, the eater of knowledge kills the target by extracting and consuming its brain."
        },
        {
          "category": "Action",
          "name": "Spellcasting (Psionics)",
          "description": "Casts one of the following spells, requiring no spell components and using Intelligence (spell save DC 15) based on brains consumed:\n1/day each: plane shift (self only, 0 brains), detect magic (1), silent image (2), invisibility (3), hypnotic pattern (4), major image (5), telekinesis (6), arcane eye (7), mislead (8), greater invisibility (9), mass suggestion (10+)"
        }
      ],
